		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3339&amp;p=26596#p26596"><![CDATA[
We don't validate the codeplug data as it would be impractical to do so as there are thousands of settings / value combinations<br><br>Like Colin says, you can put whatever value you want into virtually any of the various settings, but this may or may not work depending on what radio you are using becuase the radio hardware differs as does some of the code. i.e the code is not completely unified across all 8 supported radios<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Sep 28, 2023 9:33 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
