The hardware used to generate the CTCSS tone in the two radios is different so the firmware also differs slightly. <br><br>Although it may appear that you can program non standard tones there is no guarantee that they are actually being generated correctly.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Thu Sep 28, 2023 8:28 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
